## Findings

Each finding in a report's "What could go wrong" is one rule applied to one query's rows. The fields below are the ones the rule tests.

| Finding | Query | Fields tested |
|---|---|---|
| New course ID already in use | S1 | `course_main.course_id` of the expected new ID already exists |
| New course ID too long | S1 | Length of the expected new course ID |
| Course is available to learners | S1 | `course_main.available_ind` = `Y` |
| Test attempts open now | S12 | `attempt.status` 3, 4 or 8 on a test's grade rows |
| Timed tests with attempts open now | S12 | `course_assessment.time_limit` with open attempts |
| Tests that require a secure browser | S12 | `course_assessment.req_secure_browser_take_ind` = `Y` |
| Tests with a proctoring service | S12 | `course_assessment.proctoring_service_handle` set |
| Test exceptions (extra time or attempts) | S12b | `user_test_option` rows |
| Assignments started but not submitted | S7 | `attempt.status` 3, 4 or 8 on assignment columns (`gradebook_main.score_provider_handle`) |
| SCORM attempts in progress | S7 | `attempt.status` 3, 4 or 8 on SCORM columns |
| Work waiting to be graded | S7 | `attempt.status` 6 or 9 |
| Work waiting to be graded from students who can't open the course | S2b | `attempt.status` 6 or 9, for unavailable or disabled students |
| Partial credit in tests that open the next step | S5b | `qti_asi_data.bbmd_partialcredit` = `Y`, in a test whose column release conditions read with one score range (`avl_crit.gradebook_main_pk1`, `min_score`, `max_score`) |
| Partial credit in tests that route learners by score | S5b | The same, in a test read with two or more score ranges |
| Partial credit in graded tests | S5c | Answer weights between 0% and 100% in the question data (`qti_asi_data.data`) |
| Questions that give partial credit in proportion | S5c | Partial credit on, with no weight per answer |
| Question types that conversion removes | S5d | `qti_asi_data.bbmd_questiontype` 4, 10, 14 or 15 |
| Tests that draw questions from an undeployed test | S5f | Random blocks (`qti_block_mapping`) drawing from a test with no `course_assessment` row |
| Undeployed tests that conversion puts in a hidden folder | S5f | Tests (`qti_asi_data.bbmd_assessmenttype` 1) with no `course_assessment` row |
| Release conditions that depend on groups | S8 | `avl_crit_acl_group` rows naming a group |
| Groups with members | S8 | `group_users` rows |
| Test exceptions given to a group | S8 | `user_test_option.groups_pk1` |
| Release conditions on discussions | S9 | `avl_rule` on items with `cnthndlr_handle` `resource/x-bb-forumlink` |
| Release conditions on calculated columns | S9 | `avl_crit.gradebook_main_pk1` pointing at a column with `gradebook_main.calculated_ind` other than `N` |
| Release conditions that name individual learners | S9 | `avl_crit_acl_user` rows |
| Hidden grade columns that learners will see | S4 | `gradebook_main.visible_ind` = `N`, and the attached item's `course_contents.available_ind` = `Y` |
| Hidden grade columns not attached to an item | S4 | `gradebook_main.visible_ind` = `N`, and `gradebook_main.course_contents_pk1` empty |
| Grade columns not attached to an item | S4 | `gradebook_main.course_contents_pk1` empty, not calculated (`calculated_ind`), not created by hand (`user_created_ind`) |
| Folders nested deeper than Ultra allows | S3d | Depth from the `course_contents.parent_pk1` chain, against `system_registry` key `course.structure.max_level_of_nesting` |
| Folder descriptions that lose links, media or files | S3e | Folder text (`course_contents.main_data`) with links, images or over 750 characters, or files (`course_contents_files`), with descriptions not becoming documents |
| Folder descriptions that lose their formatting | S3e | Formatting tags in `course_contents.main_data`, with descriptions not becoming documents |
| Folder descriptions that become documents | S3e | Any folder description, with descriptions becoming documents |
| Items hidden from learners | S3b | `course_contents.available_ind` = `N` |
| Items that conversion puts in a folder of their own | S3c | Items with `cnthndlr_handle` `resource/x-bb-document` |
| Course links, Tool links | S3c | `cnthndlr_handle` `resource/x-bb-courselink`, `resource/x-bb-toollink` |
| Content that conversion removes | S3c | `cnthndlr_handle` for wikis, blogs, achievements, module pages, syllabi and self and peer assessments |
| Content types not yet covered by conversion testing | S3c | Any other `cnthndlr_handle` |
| Items with display dates | S3 | `course_contents.start_date` or `end_date` set |
| Links to the Content Collection | S3 | `course_contents.main_data` or `web_url` pointing at the Content Collection |
| HTML pages in the Content Collection | S3 | `course_contents.web_url` to an HTML file in the Content Collection |
| LTI tool links | S3 | `cnthndlr_handle` starting `resource/x-bb-blti` |
| SCORM packages with a time limit | S6 | `scormpackageproperties.time_limit` |
